{"tool_name":"pyxit-object-classification-model-builder","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<blockquote>\n<p>This module is for learning classification models from ground-truth data (supervised learning).&nbsp;It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotation images and coordinate of annotated objects from project(s) and build a annotation classification model which is saved locally.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>It is used by Cytomine DataMining applications: classification_validation, classification_model_builder, classification_prediction, segmentation_model_builder and segmentation_prediction. But it can be run without Cytomine on local data (using dir_ls and dir_ts arguments).</p>\n</blockquote>","summary":"","value":"<blockquote>\r\n<p>This module is for learning classification models from ground-truth data (supervised learning).&nbsp;It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotation images and coordinate of annotated objects from project(s) and build a annotation classification model which is saved locally.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is used by Cytomine DataMining applications: classification_validation, classification_model_builder, classification_prediction, segmentation_model_builder and segmentation_prediction. But it can be run without Cytomine on local data (using dir_ls and dir_ts arguments).</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-02T16:27:10+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-13T12:11:25+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505227261,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Rapha\u00ebl Mar\u00e9e"},{"value":"Gilles Louppe"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id"